  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the given two signs '**- and ÷'** :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 20 × 8 - 4 ÷ 2 + 7 = 50\n\n20 × **8 ÷ 4**__ - 2 + 7 = 50\n\n__**20 × 2**__ - 2 + 7 = 50\n\n__**40 + 7**__ - 2 = 50\n\n__**47 - 2**__ = 50\n\n**45 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 35 - 5 + 8 ÷ 4 × 3 = 3\n\n**35 ÷ 5**__ + 8 - 4 × 3 = 3\n\n7 + 8 - __**4 × 3**__ = 3\n\n__**7 + 8**__ - 12 = 3\n\n__**15 - 12**__ = 3\n\n3 = 3 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 10 + 8 × 6 - 4 ÷ 2 = 20\n\n10 + 8 × **6 ÷ 4**__ - 2 = 20\n\n10 + __**8 × 1.5**__ - 2 = 20\n\n__**10 + 12**__ - 2 = 20\n\n__**22 - 2**__ = 20\n\n20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 12 - 4 + 11 × 3 ÷ 8 = 28\n\n**12 ÷ 4**__ + 11 × 3 - 8 = 28\n\n3 + __**11 × 3**__ - 8 = 28\n\n__**3 + 33**__ - 8 = 28\n\n__**36 - 8**__ = 28\n\n28 = 28 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
